          "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "Cognitive-behavioral psychotherapist in Cesena, Italy, and a member of the International Society for Humor Studies, and a clown doctor, clown doctor trainer, and president of the Italian Federation of Clown Doctors, and a lecturer in the field of humor."}
        }
      },
      "ArticleTitle": "Clowning as a Complementary Approach for Reducing Iatrogenic Effects in Pediatrics.",
